se campus venue for events and athletics.","evidence_claim":"NJIT’s Bloom Wellness and Events Center is a 220,000-square-foot multipurpose building; its venues include an arena, athletic field, practice courts, and theater.","source_url":"https://strategicevents.njit.edu/event-venues","source_title":"Event Venues | NJIT Conference Services","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Entry depends on the specific event; verify the organizer’s current ticketing and attendance rules.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"njit-van-houten-library","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Robert W. Van Houten Library","title":"Make the library your Saturday anchor","subtitle":"Central Avenue Building • Saturday morning","notes":"Walk through Van Houten to find a study base and the Information Commons; save the library hours page so you can plan later visits around its schedule.","short_summary":"NJIT’s main library and research space.","evidence_claim":"Van Houten Library is NJIT’s primary facility for researching, studying, and browsing physical and online resources and includes the Information Commons.","source_url":"https://catalog.njit.edu/graduate/campus-life-student-services/library-services/","source_title":"Library Services | NJIT Catalog","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Consult the library’s current hours page before visiting, including for holiday closures.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"njit-makerspace","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"NJIT Makerspace","title":"See where prototypes take shape","subtitle":"NJIT Makerspace • Saturday midday","notes":"Visit during an authorized tour or access period to see the prototyping facility, and ask staff which training or book